description	"Commander Cody

Leader of the 212th Attack Battalion, specialized in frontline tactical command.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Jagged Vibroknife (Cyan Style)
-- No Blaster/Saber Defense
-- No Blaster Deflect
-- Low Damage (100)
- Cody's DC-17 Clone Pistol (2)
-- +15% More Damage/RoF
- Cody's DC-15S Clone Carbine (3)
-- +5% More Damage
-- +30% Faster RoF
-- +15% Faster Velocity
-- Primary Fire Only
- Grav-Grenades (Frag Grenade 2)
-- On Hit Pulls/Tracks/Slips/Staggers
- Pulse Grenades (3)
-- On Hit Cripples
- Ion Bombs (Detpack 4)
-- 100% More Damage
-- Pulses On Hit

^6Inventory:
- Portable Forcefield ^3[CS4]

^5Powers:
- Elite Tactics (Team Energize 1)

^8Attributes:
- Rally
- Blast Armor
- Environmential Protection (1)
- Healing (2)
- Anti-Mind Trick (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Stamina (3)
- Dexterity (2)
- Strength (1)
- Knockdown Roll
- 20% Less Knockback Taken
- Stat Viewer

^3Abilities:
- Sprint (2)^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Quickthrow (1) ^3[CS3]
- Armor Dispenser (2) ^3[USE In Melee]
- Grappling Hook (2) ^3[Melee CS4]"